Source: https://git.libcamera.org/libcamera/libcamera.git (tag v0.8.0)
Comment:
 This binary package also contains the libcamera SPA plugin of PipeWire
 (https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/pipewire/pipewire), built from the PipeWire
 source package of the distribution it was built for (directory pipewire-src/
 of the build tree). The libcamera source carries an SPDX header in each file
 and the licence texts in LICENSES/.

